  "description": "Scenario A8 full solution: extends pam-education 0.1.0. Pre-populates patient, unit and consultant; multi-select delivery method and materials; extracts a Procedure (education session) and a Communication. Needs the root-level extractAllocateId eduProcedureId (see README).",
